cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use judicial_common_space in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "judicial_common_space: Judicial Common Space scores for every Article III appointment"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that computes the Judicial Common Space score of every
  appointment of a federal judge who has served since 1953, following
  Epstein, Martin, Segal, and Westerland, and checks the scores against the
  published ones.
authors:
